From: Oliver Hartkopp <socketcan@hartkopp.net>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 11:27:33 +0100
Subject: [PATCH v5 4/5] can: isotp: use a private mutex instead of
 lock_sock()
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 7bit
Message-Id: <20261113-can-bcmlock-memcg-v5-4-66a65321e278@hartkopp.net>
References: <20261113-can-bcmlock-memcg-v5-0-66a65321e278@hartkopp.net>
In-Reply-To: <20261113-can-bcmlock-memcg-v5-0-66a65321e278@hartkopp.net>
To: linux-can@vger.kernel.org
Cc: Marc Kleine-Budde <mkl@pengutronix.de>, 
 Oleksij Rempel <o.rempel@pengutronix.de>, 
 Oliver Hartkopp <socketcan@hartkopp.net>
X-Mailer: b4 0.15.2
X-Developer-Signature: v=1; a=ed25519-sha256; t=1794565649; l=7524;
 i=socketcan@hartkopp.net; s=20260128; h=from:subject:message-id;
 bh=LzREcHis030hMdIGjsMovZQZPfS+OgBmYjMlE+yThHg=;
 b=k5sEaho+9TdywX0+4n1bo+NvEgzCw4vJ7/wmUt3CS9jbsLA6incKz/Thq1v9afD4ISgXmBGG0
 Oq+0HV0CGBcD94q7duqP7/iIngyAiZ481E1n4WQedFzfmeyhpvLoeyJ
